  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. Season tuna steaks with salt.",
    "3. Grill tuna for 2-3 minutes per side, or until cooked to your liking.",
    "4. In a small bowl, whisk together lime juice, soy sauce, and sesame oil.",
    "5. Brush the mixture on the tuna steaks during the last minute of grilling.",
    "6. Remove tuna from grill and let rest for 2 minutes.",
    "7. Slice tuna into thin pieces.",
    "8. In a small bowl, mix together ginger, cilantro, and red onion.",
    "9. Serve tuna with the ginger mixture spooned over the top."
